\newlabel{sec:res-uncond}{{\mbox  {VI-G}}{17}{}{}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {XI}{\ignorespaces Reads are not the only cost. Two further charging models applied to the same 300 baseline retrievals (30 syntheses $\times $ 10 read orders) as Tables~\ref {tab:actual} and~\ref {tab:dt}; the reads-only model is the Reads column itself. A multiplexed run charges 50 read-equivalents per batch of 50 reads and 500 per container library preparation; a separate sequencing run per batch charges 2{,}000 per batch. Costs in read-equivalents (thousands). Sw.: mean container switches per retrieval, recorded only by the runs with the dropout model and (for round-robin) by its bit-identical $\rho _U{=}0.03$ re-run; ``--'': not recorded on these retrievals.}}{18}{}\protected@file@percent }
